r"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/break-from-toronto.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ymbEftQiGo8","slug":"all-day-2020","tags":[19],"links":{},"state":"published","title":"Soulection All Day 2020","artwork":"/images/episodes/soulection-all-day-2020.jpg","content":"\n**🎊🌟 Happy New Year 2020 🌟🎊**\n\nA day of exclusive mixes from [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set), [Sasha Marie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set), [Budgie](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set), and [Skinny Macho](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set) to bring in the new decade. \n<!--more-->\n\n#### Jump to:\n\n- [Joe Kay's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#joe-kays-set)\n- [Sasha Marie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#sasha-maries-set)\n- [Budgie's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#budgies-set)\n- [Skinny Macho's Set](/episodes/all-day-2020/#skinny-machos-set)\n\nAlso listen to [Soulection All Day 2019](/episodes/all-day-2019/).\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2020-01-01T14:41:45+00:00"},"title":"Skinny Macho's Set","position":3}},{"id":"cjoTUoAnr_A","position":43,"timestamp":"01:32:17","rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rugs (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"UN8lbKkYYf4","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"persian-rugs-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Persian Rugs (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"Mw4mBRRhFsc","slug":"414","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-414/ra.1470719147","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-414"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #414","artwork":"images/episodes/414.png","content":"\nMusic from Daniel Caesar and Freddie Gibbs & Madlib\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2019-06-29T10:06:55+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"77KQME6byUw","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"033H0Kz0wa8","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"liNF_Uad_x0","slug":"151","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-151-w-mr"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #151 w/ Mr. Choc (Beat Junkies)","artwork":"/images/episodes/151.jpg","content":"\nFor this week's special guest if you want to talk about pioneers in the game [Mr. Choc](https://twitter.com/MrChocFan4) is one of them. \n\n<!--more-->\n\nOne of our favorite DJ's who's talent and accomplishments are not to be overlooked. \nRepresenting the world famous Beat Junkies crew and Skam Artists, the crew was blessed to have this man come by Kbeach and hit us with a set and great interview session. \nThe thing we admire the most about Choc is that he has his ears close to the new generation of music and understands the culture. \nHe threw down a really diverse set and kept us on our toes. \n\nJoe Kay was on his soulful chop vibe and has really been digging back into the classic neo-soul/boombap sound. \nMake sure you really pay attention to the interview at the end. \nSome great insight on commercial radio on the west coast as well as opportunities for upcoming DJ's. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"yAqmZB4USTg","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"71ZXZF57G88","slug":"163","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-163-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #163 w/ Little Simz","artwork":"/images/episodes/163.jpg","content":"Little Sims joins Joe Kay with an exclusive Soulection mix.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11016,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"YIvkktkQluE","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mTiCVWagnSk","slug":"165","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-165-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #165 w/ Lakim, Andres, Sunni Colòn, & J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/165.jpg","content":"Soulection 3 Year pre-party Celebration!\n<!--more-->\n\nWe had a packed house at Kbeach with plenty of good vibes flowing. In fact it was Joe's first time meeting Lakim in person after all these years. This is Lakim's first time out in L.A. so we wanted to make sure Lakim was welcomed properly. We had him drop a quick preview set on the radio show and talk about his forthcoming album \"This Is Her\" a little. We also had Andres drop a quick set to switch up the vibes, After Andres, we had Sunni Colòn & J-Louis both come on and preview some remixes that we've been putting together. So much talent in one room. Big ups to Marvel Alexander and shouts to everyone who came out to our 3 year Anniversary party. It was massive and hectic at the same time. Stay tuned for our announcement to our new Soulection monthly.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"Aqibl67Qbf4","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mTiCVWagnSk","slug":"165","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-165-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #165 w/ Lakim, Andres, Sunni Colòn, & J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/165.jpg","content":"Soulection 3 Year pre-party Celebration!\n<!--more-->\n\nWe had a packed house at Kbeach with plenty of good vibes flowing. In fact it was Joe's first time meeting Lakim in person after all these years. This is Lakim's first time out in L.A. so we wanted to make sure Lakim was welcomed properly. We had him drop a quick preview set on the radio show and talk about his forthcoming album \"This Is Her\" a little. We also had Andres drop a quick set to switch up the vibes, After Andres, we had Sunni Colòn & J-Louis both come on and preview some remixes that we've been putting together. So much talent in one room. Big ups to Marvel Alexander and shouts to everyone who came out to our 3 year Anniversary party. It was massive and hectic at the same time. Stay tuned for our announcement to our new Soulection monthly.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"fVSPXsj_c0o","position":21,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Wus Good / Curious","track":{"id":"wPS3B0H7MmI","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious/","slug":"wus-good-curious","title":"Wus Good / Curious","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/wus-good-curious.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"mTiCVWagnSk","slug":"165","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-165-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #165 w/ Lakim, Andres, Sunni Colòn, & J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/165.jpg","content":"Soulection 3 Year pre-party Celebration!\n<!--more-->\n\nWe had a packed house at Kbeach with plenty of good vibes flowing. In fact it was Joe's first time meeting Lakim in person after all these years. This is Lakim's first time out in L.A. so we wanted to make sure Lakim was welcomed properly. We had him drop a quick preview set on the radio show and talk about his forthcoming album \"This Is Her\" a little. We also had Andres drop a quick set to switch up the vibes, After Andres, we had Sunni Colòn & J-Louis both come on and preview some remixes that we've been putting together. So much talent in one room. Big ups to Marvel Alexander and shouts to everyone who came out to our 3 year Anniversary party. It was massive and hectic at the same time. Stay tuned for our announcement to our new Soulection monthly.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"0x36UlvoosA","position":20,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rug","track":{"id":"wsGkm7KSfxo","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rug/","slug":"persian-rug","title":"Persian Rug","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rug.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"iiHdl1Frjo4","slug":"166","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-166-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #166 w/ Esta & The Whooligan","artwork":"/images/episodes/166.jpg","content":"ESTA., The Whooligan and Joe Kay five you a special sonic experiance.\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10873,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-02-22T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"The Whooligan's Set","position":3}},{"id":"1SVUuZvkjAg","position":11,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rugs (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"UN8lbKkYYf4","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"persian-rugs-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Persian Rugs (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"brFh4QBhAJE","slug":"167","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-167"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #167","artwork":"/images/episodes/167.jpg","content":"Take a deep breath and slow things down with Joe Kay\n<!--more-->\n\nSo many good things have been going on in our world but sometimes it is overwhelming. However we just take a deep breath and keep it moving. This week Joe Kay wanted to slow things down a bit and just focus on the music by going solo. Joe started off with some nice neo-soul/Dilla-esque vibes and then progressed into some progressive beats to get your energy flowing. Standout artists to look out for are LOSCO. These guys have a heavy, heavy sound. Just wait til you hear. As the show progressed the engagement via social media was massive and a few people randomly requested to hear a Sango tribute so we did one! Joe dropped a 42 minute set of primarily unreleased music to keep things interesting! We hope you enjoy the show and feel free to spread it to as many people as possible. Real radio is here.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10845,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-01T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"G6ju9Y3yhOQ","position":41,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rugs","track":{"id":"EklSnTRR8ow","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs/","slug":"persian-rugs","title":"Persian Rugs","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"caCkO8N3kls","position":54,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rugs","track":{"id":"EklSnTRR8ow","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs/","slug":"persian-rugs","title":"Persian Rugs","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"jTSehXE5AIc","slug":"169","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-169"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #169","artwork":"/images/episodes/169.jpg","content":"Plenty of new music stacked ready to share with you.\n<!--more-->\n\nIt felt good to be back after being away from the studio for 4 weeks. We've been traveling for the past month spreading The Sound of Tomorrow at SXSW, WMC, and now Asia. The pros of being away for so long meant that Joe stacked up on plenty of music for the past month which makes up for the lost time, trust. There is too much to say and talk about but shout out to all of the amazing people who came out to our shows to see and connect with us. We are very grateful!\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10838,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"NvfE0lurcQI","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - West District","track":{"id":"Fhm97sSuNJ0","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/west-district/","slug":"west-district","title":"West District","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/west-district.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"IDGU64UVi08","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - Persian Rugs","track":{"id":"EklSnTRR8ow","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs/","slug":"persian-rugs","title":"Persian Rugs","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/persian-rugs.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"laWaR2BCPmc","slug":"185","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-185-w-fortune"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #185 w/ Fortune","artwork":"/images/episodes/185.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10764,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-08-30T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"F3VwSYFU-Ew","position":85,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"PARTYNEXTDOOR - West District","track":{"id":"Fhm97sSuNJ0","path":"/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/west-district/","slug":"west-district","title":"West District","artist":{"slug":"partynextdoor","title":"PartyNextDoor"},"artwork":"images/artists/partynextdoor/tracks/west-district.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9hHKn1wcY4c","slug":"186","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-186"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #186","artwork":"/images/episodes/186.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":